  "description": "Han Sun-yul has long been scarred by a scandal involving her college sweetheart, Yoo Shin.\nAfter eight years, he reappeared in front of her, leaving nothing but shameful rumors and resentment for Yoo Shin, who evaporated in an instant.\n“Did you miss me?”\n“What?”\n“You had that look on your face.”\nAs if that weren't bad enough, he brazenly reappeared as if nothing had happened,\n“Don't marry Kim Ki-chul.”\n“He's worse than you can imagine. He'll only hurt you.”\nSun-yeon can't understand why he's so intent on her boyfriend, Ki-chul.\nBut she soon realizes that there's something between Yoo Shin and Ki-chul that she doesn't understand...\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63477853), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A6%BD%EC%84%9C%EB%B9%84%EC%8A%A4/3940), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885046097), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13934107), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/lip-service), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lip_service) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/165644), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/lip-service/list?title_no=9834)",
